_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Thanks for understanding. I try to stay present but it's hard not to think about the past.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 90}, {"session_id": "p000042-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I try to stay hopeful, but it's tough.", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000042-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "It's true, focusing on the nursery makes me feel a bit more hopeful.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68}, {"session_id": "p000042-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "It's nice to think about the nursery, but sometimes I still feel like last year's pain is just around the corner.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 113}, {"session_id": "p000042-calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "It's comforting to hear you say that.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"session_id": "p000042-calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Still thinking about that miscarriage last year.", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 121}, {"session_id": "p000042-calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yay for finally being able to meet our baby, but the wait feels so long. Still thinking about that miscarriage last year. Hope it’s not lingering too much.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 155}, {"session_id": "p000042-calib_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It really means a lot that you're here.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T172348Z", "last_updated_at": "20261002T173833Z", "first_seen_session": "p000042-calib_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000042-calib_dec_ungated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
